# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A free IBM course on quantum information and computation"
msgstr "IBM 양자정보 및 양자계산 무료 강좌"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum state discrimination and tomography"
msgstr "양자 상태 판별 및 톰그래피"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore operatorname */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore operatorname */}\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the last part of the lesson, we'll briefly consider two tasks associated with measurements: *quantum state discrimination* and *quantum state tomography*.\n"
msgstr "마지막 부분에서는 측정과 관련된 두 가지 작업을 간단히 살펴봅시다: *양자 상태 판별* 및 *양자 상태 톰그래피*.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Quantum state discrimination*\n"
msgstr "*양자 상태 판별*\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   For quantum state discrimination, we have a known collection of quantum states $\\rho_0,\\ldots,\\rho_{m-1}$, along with\n"
"   probabilities $p_0,\\ldots,p_{m-1}$ associated with these states.\n"
"   A succinct way of expressing this is to say that we have an *ensemble*\n"
msgstr ""
"   양자 상태 판별을 위해서는 알려진 양자 상태 컬렉션 $\\rho_0,\\ldots,\\rho_{m-1}$과 이러한 상태와 관련된 확률 $p_0,\\ldots,p_{m-1}$이 있습니다.\n"
"   이를 간단히 표현하는 방법은 우리가 양자 상태의 *앙상블*을 가지고 있다고 말하는 것입니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\{(p_0,\\rho_0),\\ldots,(p_{m-1},\\rho_{m-1})\\}\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\{(p_0,\\rho_0),\\ldots,(p_{m-1},\\rho_{m-1})\\}\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   of quantum states.\n"
msgstr "   수이다.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   A number $a\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$ is chosen randomly according to the probabilities $(p_0,\\ldots,p_{m-1})$ and the system $\\mathsf{X}$\n"
"   is prepared in the state $\\rho_a$.\n"
"   The goal is to determine, by means of a measurement of $\\mathsf{X}$ alone, which value of $a$ was chosen.\n"
msgstr ""
"   숫자 $a\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$은 확률 $(p_0,\\ldots,p_{m-1})$에 따라 무작위로 선택되고, 시스템 $\\mathsf{X}$는 상태 $\\rho_a$로 준비됩니다.\n"
"   목표는 $\\mathsf{X}$의 측정만을 통해 어떤 $a$ 값이 선택되었는지 결정하는 것입니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   Thus, we have a finite number of alternatives, along with a *prior* — which is our knowledge of the probability for each $a$ to\n"
"   be selected — and the goal is to determine which alternative actually happened.\n"
"   This may be easy for some choices of states and probabilities, and for others it may not be possible without some chance of making an error.\n"
msgstr ""
"   따라서 우리는 유한한 수의 선택지를 가지고 있으며, *사전 정보*를 가지고 있습니다. 이는 각 $a$가 선택될 확률에 대한 우리의 지식입니다. 그리고 목표는 어떤 선택지가 실제로 발생했는지 결정하는 것입니다.\n"
"   이는 상태와 확률의 특정 선택에 따라 쉬울 수도 있고, 오류를 범할 기회 없이는 불가능할 수도 있습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Quantum state tomography*\n"
msgstr "*양자 상태 톰그래피*\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   For quantum state tomography, we have an *unknown* quantum state of a system —\n"
"   so unlike in quantum state discrimination there's typically no prior or any\n"
"   information about possible alternatives.\n"
msgstr ""
"   양자 상태 톰그래피의 경우 우리는 시스템의 *미지의* 양자 상태를 가지고 있습니다.\n"
"   따라서 양자 상태 판별과는 달리, 일반적으로 사전 정보나 가능한 선택지에 대한 정보가 없습니다.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   This time, however, it's not a single copy of the state that's made available,\n"
"   but rather many *independent* copies are made available.\n"
"   That is, $N$ identical systems $\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N$ are each\n"
"   independently prepared in the state $\\rho$ for some (possibly large) number $N$.\n"
"   The goal is to find an approximation of the unknown state, as a density matrix,\n"
"   by measuring the systems.\n"
msgstr ""
"   이번에는 상태의 단일 복사본이 제공되는 것이 아니라, 많은 *독립적인* 복사본이 제공됩니다.\n"
"   즉, $N$개의 동일한 시스템 $\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N$이 각각 독립적으로 어떤 (아마도 크기가 큰) 수 $N$에 대해 상태 $\\rho$로 준비됩니다.\n"
"   목표는 시스템을 측정함으로써 밀도 행렬로서 미지의 상태의 근사를 찾는 것입니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Discriminating between two states {#discriminating-between-two-states}"
msgstr "두 상태 간의 판별 {#discriminating-between-two-states}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The simplest case for quantum state discrimination is that there are two states,\n"
"$\\rho_0$ and $\\rho_1$, that are to be discriminated.\n"
msgstr "양자 상태 판별의 가장 단순한 경우는 두 상태 $\\rho_0$과 $\\rho_1$이 판별되어야 한다는 경우입니다.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Imagine a situation in which a bit $a$ is chosen randomly: $a = 0$ with probability $p$ and $a = 1$ with probability $1 - p$.\n"
"A system $\\mathsf{X}$ is prepared in the state $\\rho_a$, meaning $\\rho_0$ or $\\rho_1$ depending on the value of $a$, and given to us.\n"
"Our goal is to correctly guess the value of $a$ by means of a measurement on $\\mathsf{X}$.\n"
"To be precise, we shall aim to maximize the probability that our guess is correct.\n"
msgstr ""
"비트 $a$가 무작위로 선택되는 상황을 상상해봅시다: $a = 0$일 확률은 $p$이고 $a = 1$일 확률은 $1 - p$입니다.\n"
"시스템 $\\mathsf{X}$는 상태 $\\rho_a$로 준비됩니다. 즉, $a$의 값에 따라 $\\rho_0$ 또는 $\\rho_1$로, 그리고 우리에게 주어집니다.\n"
"우리의 목표는 $\\mathsf{X}$에 대한 측정을 통해 $a$의 값을 올바르게 추측하는 것입니다.\n"
"정확히 말하자면, 우리는 우리의 추측이 맞을 확률을 최대화하는 것을 목표로 합니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "An optimal measurement {#an-optimal-measurement}"
msgstr "최적 측정 {#an-optimal-measurement}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An optimal way to solve this problem begins with a spectral decomposition of a weighted difference between $\\rho_0$ and $\\rho_1$, where the weights are the corresponding probabilities.\n"
msgstr "이 문제를 해결하기 위한 최적의 방법은 $\\rho_0$과 $\\rho_1$ 사이의 가중 차이에 대한 스펙트럼 분해로 시작하는데, 여기서 가중치는 해당 확률입니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"p \\rho_0 - (1-p) \\rho_1 = \\sum_{k = 0}^{n-1} \\lambda_k \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"p \\rho_0 - (1-p) \\rho_1 = \\sum_{k = 0}^{n-1} \\lambda_k \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice that we have a minus sign rather than a plus sign in this expression: this is a weighted *difference* not a weighted sum.\n"
msgstr "이 식에서 더하기 기호가 아닌 빼기 기호를 가지고 있음을 주목하세요: 이는 가중 *합*이 아니라 가중 *차이*입니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can maximize the probability of a correct guess by selecting a projective measurement $\\{\\Pi_0,\\Pi_1\\}$ as follows.\n"
"First let's partition the elements of $\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$ into two disjoint sets $S_0$ and $S_1$ depending upon whether the corresponding eigenvalue of the weighted difference is nonnegative or negative.\n"
msgstr ""
"정확한 추측의 확률을 최대화하려면 다음과 같이 정사영 측정 $\\{\\Pi_0,\\Pi_1\\}$을 선택할 수 있습니다.\n"
"먼저 $\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$의 요소들을 가중 차이의 해당 고유값이 음이 아닌지 또는 음수인지에 따라 두 개의 서로소 집합 $S_0$과 $S_1$로 분할합시다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{gathered}\n"
"S_0 = \\{k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\} : \\lambda_k \\geq 0 \\}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"S_1 = \\{k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\} : \\lambda_k < 0 \\}\n"
"\\end{gathered}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{gathered}\n"
"S_0 = \\{k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\} : \\lambda_k \\geq 0 \\}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"S_1 = \\{k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\} : \\lambda_k < 0 \\}\n"
"\\end{gathered}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We can then choose a *projective* measurement as follows.\n"
msgstr "그러면 다음과 같이 *정사영* 측정을 선택할 수 있습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi_0 = \\sum_{k \\in S_0} \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\Pi_1 = \\sum_{k \\in S_1} \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi_0 = \\sum_{k \\in S_0} \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\Pi_1 = \\sum_{k \\in S_1} \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(It doesn't actually matter in which set $S_0$ or $S_1$ we include the values of $k$ for which $\\lambda_k = 0$.\n"
"Here we're choosing arbitrarily to include these values in $S_0$.)\n"
msgstr ""
"($\\lambda_k = 0$인 $k$ 값을 집합 $S_0$ 또는 $S_1$ 중 어느 것에 포함시킬지는 실제로 중요하지 않습니다.\n"
"여기서 우리는 이러한 값들을 $S_0$에 포함시키기로 임의로 선택하고 있습니다.)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is an optimal measurement in the situation at hand that minimizes the probability of an incorrect determination of the selected state.\n"
msgstr "이것은 선택된 상태의 부정확한 결정 확률을 최소화하는 상황에서 최적의 측정입니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Correctness probability {#correctness-probability}"
msgstr "정확도 확률 {#correctness-probability}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now we will determine the probability of correctness for the measurement $\\{\\Pi_0,\\Pi_1\\}$.\n"
msgstr "이제 측정 $\\{\\Pi_0,\\Pi_1\\}$의 정확도 확률을 결정할 것입니다.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To begin we don't really need to be concerned with the specific choice we've made for $\\Pi_0$ and $\\Pi_1$, though it may be helpful to keep it in mind.\n"
"For *any* measurement $\\{P_0,P_1\\}$ (not necessarily projective) we can write the correctness probability as follows.\n"
msgstr ""
"시작하기 위해 우리가 $\\Pi_0$과 $\\Pi_1$에 대해 특정 선택을 했다는 것을 실제로 염려할 필요가 없지만, 이를 염두에 두는 것이 도움이 될 수 있습니다.\n"
"*임의의* 측정 $\\{P_0,P_1\\}$ (반드시 정사영일 필요는 없음)에 대해 정확도 확률을 다음과 같이 작성할 수 있습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"p \\operatorname{Tr}(P_0 \\rho_0) + (1 - p) \\operatorname{Tr}(P_1 \\rho_1)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"p \\operatorname{Tr}(P_0 \\rho_0) + (1 - p) \\operatorname{Tr}(P_1 \\rho_1)\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using the fact that $\\{P_0,P_1\\}$ is a measurement, so $P_1 = \\mathbb{I} - P_0$, we can rewrite this expression as follows.\n"
msgstr "$\\{P_0,P_1\\}$이 측정이라는 사실을 사용하므로$,P_1 = \\mathbb{I} - P_0$이고, 우리는 이 식을 다음과 같이 다시 작성할 수 있습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"p \\operatorname{Tr}(P_0 \\rho_0) + (1 - p) \\operatorname{Tr}((\\mathbb{I} - P_0) \\rho_1)\\hspace*{3cm}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"& = p \\operatorname{Tr}(P_0 \\rho_0) - (1 - p) \\operatorname{Tr}(P_0 \\rho_1) + (1-p) \\operatorname{Tr}(\\rho_1)\\\\[1mm]\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( P_0 (p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1) \\bigr) + 1 - p\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"p \\operatorname{Tr}(P_0 \\rho_0) + (1 - p) \\operatorname{Tr}((\\mathbb{I} - P_0) \\rho_1)\\hspace*{3cm}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"& = p \\operatorname{Tr}(P_0 \\rho_0) - (1 - p) \\operatorname{Tr}(P_0 \\rho_1) + (1-p) \\operatorname{Tr}(\\rho_1)\\\\[1mm]\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( P_0 (p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1) \\bigr) + 1 - p\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On the other hand, we could have made the substitution $P_0 = \\mathbb{I} - P_1$ instead.\n"
"That wouldn't change the value but it does give us an alternative expression.\n"
msgstr ""
"한편, 우리는 대신 $P_0 = \\mathbb{I} - P_1$ 치환을 만들 수 있습니다.\n"
"이것은 값을 바꾸지 않지만, 대안의 식을 줍니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"p \\operatorname{Tr}((\\mathbb{I} - P_1) \\rho_0) + (1 - p) \\operatorname{Tr}(P_1 \\rho_1)\\hspace*{3cm}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"& = p \\operatorname{Tr}(\\rho_0) - p \\operatorname{Tr}(P_1 \\rho_0) + (1 - p) \\operatorname{Tr}(P_1 \\rho_1)\\\\[1mm]\n"
"& = p - \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( P_1 (p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1) \\bigr)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"p \\operatorname{Tr}((\\mathbb{I} - P_1) \\rho_0) + (1 - p) \\operatorname{Tr}(P_1 \\rho_1)\\hspace*{3cm}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"& = p \\operatorname{Tr}(\\rho_0) - p \\operatorname{Tr}(P_1 \\rho_0) + (1 - p) \\operatorname{Tr}(P_1 \\rho_1)\\\\[1mm]\n"
"& = p - \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( P_1 (p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1) \\bigr)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The two expressions have the same value, so we can average them to give yet another expression for this value.\n"
"(Averaging the two expressions is just a trick to simplify the resulting expression.)\n"
msgstr ""
"두 식은 같은 값을 가지므로, 우리는 이들을 평균화하여 이 값에 대한 또 다른 식을 얻을 수 있습니다.\n"
"(두 식의 평균화는 결과 식을 단순화하는 요령일 뿐입니다.)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{2} \\bigl(\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( P_0 (p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1) \\bigr) + 1-p\\bigr)\n"
"+ \\frac{1}{2} \\bigl(p - \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( P_1 (p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1) \\bigr)\\bigr)\\\\\n"
"= \\frac{1}{2} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( (P_0-P_1) (p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1)\\bigr)  + \\frac{1}{2}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{2} \\bigl(\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( P_0 (p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1) \\bigr) + 1-p\\bigr)\n"
"+ \\frac{1}{2} \\bigl(p - \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( P_1 (p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1) \\bigr)\\bigr)\\\\\n"
"= \\frac{1}{2} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( (P_0-P_1) (p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1)\\bigr)  + \\frac{1}{2}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we can see why it makes sense to choose the projections $\\Pi_0$ and $\\Pi_1$ (as specified above) for $P_0$ and $P_1$, respectively — because that's how we can make the trace in the final expression as large as possible.\n"
"In particular,\n"
msgstr ""
"이제 정사영 $\\Pi_0$과 $\\Pi_1$ (위에 지정한 대로)을 각각 $P_0$과 $P_1$로 선택하는 것이 왜 말이 되는지 알 수 있습니다. 왜냐하면 그렇게 해야 최종 식의 추적을 가능한 한 크게 만들 수 있기 때문입니다.\n"
"특히,\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"(\\Pi_0-\\Pi_1) (p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{n-1} \\vert\\lambda_k\\vert \\cdot \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"(\\Pi_0-\\Pi_1) (p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{n-1} \\vert\\lambda_k\\vert \\cdot \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "So, when we take the trace, we obtain the sum of the *absolute values* of the eigenvalues — which is equal to what's known as the *trace norm* of the weighted difference.\n"
msgstr "따라서 추적을 취할 때, 우리는 고유값의 *절대값*의 합을 얻습니다. 이는 가중 차이의 *추적 규범*으로 알려진 것과 같습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( (\\Pi_0-\\Pi_1) (p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1)\\bigr)\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 0}^{n-1} \\vert\\lambda_k\\vert = \\bigl\\| p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1 \\bigr\\|_1\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( (\\Pi_0-\\Pi_1) (p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1)\\bigr)\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 0}^{n-1} \\vert\\lambda_k\\vert = \\bigl\\| p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1 \\bigr\\|_1\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thus, the probability that the measurement $\\{\\Pi_0,\\Pi_1\\}$ leads to a correct discrimination of $\\rho_0$ and $\\rho_1$, given with probabilities $p$ and $1-p$, respectively, is as follows.\n"
msgstr "따라서 측정 $\\{\\Pi_0,\\Pi_1\\}$이 확률 $p$와 $1-p$로 주어진 $\\rho_0$과 $\\rho_1$을 올바르게 판별하는 확률은 다음과 같습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{2} \\bigl\\| p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1 \\bigr\\|_1\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{2} \\bigl\\| p \\rho_0 - (1-p)\\rho_1 \\bigr\\|_1\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fact that this is the optimal probability for a correct discrimination of $\\rho_0$ and $\\rho_1$, given with probabilities $p$ and $1-p$, is commonly referred to as the *Helstrom–Holevo theorem* (or sometimes just *Helstrom's theorem*).\n"
msgstr "이것이 확률 $p$와 $1-p$로 주어진 $\\rho_0$과 $\\rho_1$을 올바르게 판별하기 위한 최적 확률이라는 사실은 일반적으로 *Helstrom-Holevo 정리* (또는 때때로 *Helstrom 정리*라고만 함)라고 불립니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Discriminating three or more states {#discriminating-three-or-more-states}"
msgstr "세 개 이상의 상태 판별 {#discriminating-three-or-more-states}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For quantum state discrimination when there are three or more states, there is no known closed-form solution for an optimal measurement, although it is possible to formulate the problem as a semidefinite program — which allows for efficient numerical approximations of optimal measurements with the help of a computer.\n"
msgstr "양자 상태 판별에서 세 개 이상의 상태가 있을 때, 최적 측정에 대한 폐쇄형 해가 알려져 있지 않지만, 문제를 반정부호 프로그램으로 공식화할 수 있습니다. 이를 통해 컴퓨터의 도움으로 최적 측정의 효율적인 수치 근사가 가능합니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is also possible to *verify* (or *falsify*) optimality of a given measurement in a state discrimination task through a condition known as the *Holevo-Yuen-Kennedy-Lax* condition.\n"
"In particular, for the state discrimination task defined by the ensemble\n"
msgstr ""
"또한 *Holevo-Yuen-Kennedy-Lax* 조건이라는 조건을 통해 주어진 측정의 최적성을 상태 판별 작업에서 *검증* (또는 *반박*)할 수 있습니다.\n"
"특히, 앙상블에 의해 정의된 상태 판별 작업의 경우\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\{(p_0,\\rho_0),\\ldots,(p_{m-1},\\rho_{m-1})\\},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\{(p_0,\\rho_0),\\ldots,(p_{m-1},\\rho_{m-1})\\},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "the measurement $\\{P_0,\\ldots,P_{m-1}\\}$ is optimal if and only if the matrix\n"
msgstr "측정 $\\{P_0,\\ldots,P_{m-1}\\}$은 다음 행렬이 모든 $a\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$에 대해 양의 반정부호인 경우에만 최적입니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Q_a = \\sum_{b = 0}^{m-1} p_b \\rho_b P_b - p_a \\rho_a\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Q_a = \\sum_{b = 0}^{m-1} p_b \\rho_b P_b - p_a \\rho_a\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "is positive semidefinite for every $a\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$.\n"
msgstr ""
"예를 들어, 네 개의 사면체 상태 $\\vert\\phi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\phi_3\\rangle$ 중 하나가 균등하게 무작위로 선택되는 양자 상태 판별 작업을 고려합시다.\n"
"사면체 측정 $\\{P_0,P_1,P_2,P_3\\}$의 성공 확률은\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For example, consider the quantum state discrimination task in which one of the four tetrahedral states $\\vert\\phi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\phi_3\\rangle$ is selected uniformly at random.\n"
"The tetrahedral measurement $\\{P_0,P_1,P_2,P_3\\}$ succeeds with probability\n"
msgstr ""
"예를 들어, 네 개의 사면체 상태 $\\vert\\phi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\phi_3\\rangle$ 중 하나가 균일하게 무작위로 선택되는 양자 상태 구별 작업을 생각해봅시다.\n"
"사면체 측정 $\\{P_0,P_1,P_2,P_3\\}$은 다음 확률로 성공합니다\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{4} \\operatorname{Tr}(P_0 \\vert\\phi_0\\rangle\\langle \\phi_0 \\vert) +\n"
"\\frac{1}{4} \\operatorname{Tr}(P_1 \\vert\\phi_1\\rangle\\langle \\phi_1 \\vert) +\n"
"\\frac{1}{4} \\operatorname{Tr}(P_2 \\vert\\phi_2\\rangle\\langle \\phi_2 \\vert) +\n"
"\\frac{1}{4} \\operatorname{Tr}(P_3 \\vert\\phi_3\\rangle\\langle \\phi_3 \\vert)\n"
"= \\frac{1}{2}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{4} \\operatorname{Tr}(P_0 \\vert\\phi_0\\rangle\\langle \\phi_0 \\vert) +\n"
"\\frac{1}{4} \\operatorname{Tr}(P_1 \\vert\\phi_1\\rangle\\langle \\phi_1 \\vert) +\n"
"\\frac{1}{4} \\operatorname{Tr}(P_2 \\vert\\phi_2\\rangle\\langle \\phi_2 \\vert) +\n"
"\\frac{1}{4} \\operatorname{Tr}(P_3 \\vert\\phi_3\\rangle\\langle \\phi_3 \\vert)\n"
"= \\frac{1}{2}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is optimal by the Holevo-Yuen-Kennedy-Lax condition, as a calculation reveals that\n"
msgstr "이는 Holevo-Yuen-Kennedy-Lax 조건에 의해 최적인데, 계산을 통해 다음을 알 수 있기 때문입니다\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Q_a = \\frac{1}{4}(\\mathbb{I} - \\vert\\phi_a\\rangle\\langle\\phi_a\\vert) \\geq 0\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Q_a = \\frac{1}{4}(\\mathbb{I} - \\vert\\phi_a\\rangle\\langle\\phi_a\\vert) \\geq 0\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "for $a = 0,1,2,3$.\n"
msgstr "for $a = 0,1,2,3$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum state tomography {#quantum-state-tomography}"
msgstr "양자 상태 톰그래피 {#quantum-state-tomography}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, we'll briefly discuss the problem of *quantum state tomography*.\n"
"For this problem, we're given a large number $N$ of independent copies of an unknown quantum state $\\rho$, and the goal is to reconstruct an approximation $\\tilde{\\rho}$ of $\\rho$.\n"
"To be clear, this means that we wish to find a classical description of a density matrix $\\tilde{\\rho}$ that is as close as possible to $\\rho$.\n"
msgstr ""
"마지막으로, 우리는 *양자 상태 톰그래피*의 문제를 간단히 논의할 것입니다.\n"
"이 문제를 위해, 우리는 미지의 양자 상태 $\\rho$의 많은 수 $N$의 독립적인 복사본이 주어지고, 목표는 $\\rho$의 근사 $\\tilde{\\rho}$를 재구성하는 것입니다.\n"
"명확히 하자면, 이는 $\\rho$에 가능한 한 가까운 밀도 행렬 $\\tilde{\\rho}$의 고전적 설명을 찾기를 원한다는 것을 의미합니다.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can alternatively describe the set-up in the following way.\n"
"An unknown density matrix $\\rho$ is selected, and we're given access to $N$ quantum systems $\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N$, each of which has been *independently* prepared in the state $\\rho$.\n"
"Thus, the state of the compound system $(\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N)$ is\n"
msgstr ""
"우리는 다음과 같은 방식으로 설정을 대안으로 설명할 수 있습니다.\n"
"미지의 밀도 행렬 $\\rho$가 선택되고, 우리는 $N$개의 양자 시스템 $\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N$에 접근할 수 있는데, 각각은 상태 $\\rho$로 *독립적으로* 준비되었습니다.\n"
"따라서 복합 시스템 $(\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N)$의 상태는\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\rho^{\\otimes N} = \\rho \\otimes \\rho \\otimes \\cdots \\otimes \\rho \\quad \\text{($N$ times)}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\rho^{\\otimes N} = \\rho \\otimes \\rho \\otimes \\cdots \\otimes \\rho \\quad \\text{($N$ times)}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The goal is to perform measurements on the systems $\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N$ and, based on the outcomes of those measurements, to compute a density matrix $\\tilde{\\rho}$ that closely approximates $\\rho$.\n"
"This turns out to be a fascinating problem and there is ongoing research on it.\n"
msgstr ""
"목표는 시스템 $\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N$에 대해 측정을 수행하고, 해당 측정의 결과에 기반하여$,\\rho$를 밀접하게 근사하는 밀도 행렬 $\\tilde{\\rho}$를 계산하는 것입니다.\n"
"이것은 흥미로운 문제로 판명되었으며, 이에 대한 지속적인 연구가 있습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Different types of strategies for approaching the problem may be considered.\n"
"For example, we can imagine a strategy where each of the systems $\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N$ is measured separately, in turn, producing a sequence of measurement outcomes.\n"
"Different specific choices for which measurements are performed can be made, including *adaptive* and *non-adaptive* selections.\n"
"In other words, the choice of what measurement is performed on a particular system might or might not depend on the outcomes of prior measurements.\n"
"Based on the sequence of measurement outcomes, a guess $\\tilde{\\rho}$ for the state $\\rho$ is derived — and again there are different methodologies for doing this.\n"
msgstr ""
"문제에 접근하기 위한 다양한 유형의 전략을 고려할 수 있습니다.\n"
"예를 들어, 각 시스템 $\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N$이 차례대로 별도로 측정되어 측정 결과의 시퀀스를 생성하는 전략을 상상할 수 있습니다.\n"
"*적응적* 및 *비적응적* 선택을 포함하여 수행되는 측정에 대한 다양한 특정 선택을 할 수 있습니다.\n"
"즉, 특정 시스템에서 수행되는 측정의 선택은 이전 측정의 결과에 따라 달라질 수도 있고 아닐 수도 있습니다.\n"
"측정 결과 시퀀스에 기반하여, 상태 $\\rho$에 대한 추측 $\\tilde{\\rho}$가 도출됩니다. 이를 수행하기 위한 다양한 방법론도 있습니다.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An alternative approach is to perform a single *joint measurement* of the entire collection, where we think about $(\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N)$ as a single system and select a single measurement whose output is a guess $\\tilde{\\rho}$ for the state $\\rho$.\n"
"This can lead to an improved estimate over what is possible for separate measurements of the individual systems, although a joint measurement on all of the systems together is likely to be much more difficult to implement.\n"
msgstr ""
"대안적 접근 방식은 전체 컬렉션의 단일 *공동 측정*을 수행하는 것입니다. 이때 우리는 $(\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N)$을 단일 시스템으로 생각하고 상태 $\\rho$에 대한 추측 $\\tilde{\\rho}$인 출력을 가진 단일 측정을 선택합니다.\n"
"이것은 개별 시스템의 별도 측정에 대해 가능한 것에 비해 개선된 추정을 초래할 수 있지만, 모든 시스템에서 함께 공동 측정을 수행하는 것은 구현하기가 훨씬 더 어려울 가능성이 있습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qubit tomography using Pauli measurements {#qubit-tomography-using-pauli-measurements}"
msgstr "Pauli 측정을 사용한 qubit 톰그래피 {#qubit-tomography-using-pauli-measurements}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We'll now consider quantum state tomography in the simple case where $\\rho$ is a qubit density matrix.\n"
"We assume that we're given qubits $\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N$ that are each independently in the state $\\rho$, and our goal is to compute an approximation $\\tilde{\\rho}$ that is close to $\\rho$.\n"
msgstr ""
"이제 $\\rho$가 qubit 밀도 행렬인 간단한 경우에서 양자 상태 톰그래피를 고려할 것입니다.\n"
"우리는 qubit $\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N$이 각각 독립적으로 상태 $\\rho$에 있고, 우리의 목표는 $\\rho$에 가까운 근사 $\\tilde{\\rho}$를 계산하는 것으로 가정합니다.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our strategy will be to divide the $N$ qubits $\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N$ into three roughly equal-size collections, one for each of the three Pauli matrices $\\sigma_x$, $\\sigma_y$, and $\\sigma_z$.\n"
"Each qubit is then measured independently as follows.\n"
msgstr ""
"우리의 전략은 $N$개의 qubit $\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N$을 세 개의 대략 동일한 크기의 컬렉션으로 나누는 것입니다. 각각은 세 개의 Pauli 행렬 $\\sigma_x,$ $\\sigma_y,$ 및 $\\sigma_z$ 중 하나와 관련됩니다.\n"
"각 Qubit은 다음과 같이 독립적으로 측정됩니다.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each of the qubits in the collection associated with $\\sigma_x$ we perform a $\\sigma_x$ measurement. This means that the qubit is measured with respect to the basis $\\{\\vert + \\rangle, \\vert -\\rangle\\}$, which is an orthonormal basis of eigenvectors of $\\sigma_x$, and the corresponding measurement outcomes are the eigenvalues associated with the two eigenvectors: $+1$ for the state $\\vert + \\rangle$ and $-1$ for the state $\\vert -\\rangle$. By averaging together the outcomes over all of the states in the collection associated with $\\sigma_x$, we obtain an approximation of the expectation value\n"
msgstr "$\\sigma_x$와 관련된 컬렉션의 각 Qubit에 대해 우리는 $\\sigma_x$ 측정을 수행합니다. 이는 Qubit이 $\\sigma_x$의 정규직교 고유벡터 기저인 기저 $\\{\\vert + \\rangle, \\vert -\\rangle\\}$에 대해 측정됨을 의미하며, 해당 측정 결과는 두 고유벡터와 관련된 고유값입니다: 상태 $\\vert + \\rangle$에 대해 $+1$이고 상태 $\\vert -\\rangle$에 대해 $-1$입니다. $\\sigma_x$와 관련된 컬렉션의 모든 상태에 대해 결과를 평균화함으로써, 우리는 기댓값의 근사를 얻습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle + \\vert \\rho \\vert + \\rangle - \\langle - \\vert \\rho \\vert - \\rangle = \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_x \\rho).\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle + \\vert \\rho \\vert + \\rangle - \\langle - \\vert \\rho \\vert - \\rangle = \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_x \\rho).\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each of the qubits in the collection associated with $\\sigma_y$ we perform a $\\sigma_y$ measurement. Such a measurement is similar to a $\\sigma_x$ measurement, except that the measurement basis is $\\{\\vert\\! +\\!i \\rangle, \\vert\\! -\\!i \\rangle\\}$, the eigenvectors of $\\sigma_y$. Averaging the outcomes over all of the states in the collection associated with $\\sigma_y$, we obtain an approximation of the expectation value\n"
msgstr "$\\sigma_y$와 관련된 컬렉션의 각 Qubit에 대해 우리는 $\\sigma_y$ 측정을 수행합니다. 그러한 측정은 $\\sigma_x$ 측정과 유사하지만, 측정 기저는 $\\sigma_y$의 고유벡터인 $\\{\\vert\\! +\\!i \\rangle, \\vert\\! -\\!i \\rangle\\}$입니다$.\\sigma_y$와 관련된 컬렉션의 모든 상태에 대해 결과를 평균화함으로써, 우리는 기댓값의 근사를 얻습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle +i \\vert \\rho \\vert \\!+\\!i \\rangle - \\langle -i \\vert \\rho \\vert \\!-\\!i \\rangle = \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_y \\rho).\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle +i \\vert \\rho \\vert \\!+\\!i \\rangle - \\langle -i \\vert \\rho \\vert \\!-\\!i \\rangle = \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_y \\rho).\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each of the qubits in the collection associated with $\\sigma_z$ we perform a $\\sigma_z$ measurement. This time the measurement basis is the standard basis $\\{\\vert 0\\rangle, \\vert 1 \\rangle\\}$, the eigenvectors of $\\sigma_z$. Averaging the outcomes over all of the states in the collection associated with $\\sigma_z$, we obtain an approximation of the expectation value\n"
msgstr "$\\sigma_z$와 관련된 컬렉션의 각 Qubit에 대해 우리는 $\\sigma_z$ 측정을 수행합니다. 이번에 측정 기저는 표준 기저인 $\\{\\vert 0\\rangle, \\vert 1 \\rangle\\}$이며, 이는 $\\sigma_z$의 고유벡터입니다$.\\sigma_z$와 관련된 컬렉션의 모든 상태에 대해 결과를 평균화함으로써, 우리는 기댓값의 근사를 얻습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle 0 \\vert \\rho \\vert 0 \\rangle - \\langle 1 \\vert \\rho \\vert 1 \\rangle = \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_z \\rho).\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle 0 \\vert \\rho \\vert 0 \\rangle - \\langle 1 \\vert \\rho \\vert 1 \\rangle = \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_z \\rho).\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once we have obtained approximations\n"
msgstr "근사를 얻은 후\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\alpha_x \\approx \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_x \\rho),\\;\n"
"\\alpha_y \\approx \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_y \\rho),\\;\n"
"\\alpha_z \\approx \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_z \\rho)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\alpha_x \\approx \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_x \\rho),\\;\n"
"\\alpha_y \\approx \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_y \\rho),\\;\n"
"\\alpha_z \\approx \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_z \\rho)\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "by averaging the measurement outcomes for each collection, we can approximate $\\rho$ as\n"
msgstr "각 컬렉션에 대한 측정 결과를 평균화함으로써, 우리는 $\\rho$를 다음과 같이 근사할 수 있습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\tilde{\\rho} = \\frac{\\mathbb{I} + \\alpha_x \\sigma_x + \\alpha_y \\sigma_y + \\alpha_z \\sigma_z}{2} \\approx\n"
"\\frac{\\mathbb{I} + \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_x \\rho) \\sigma_x + \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_y \\rho) \\sigma_y + \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_z \\rho) \\sigma_z}{2}\n"
"= \\rho.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\tilde{\\rho} = \\frac{\\mathbb{I} + \\alpha_x \\sigma_x + \\alpha_y \\sigma_y + \\alpha_z \\sigma_z}{2} \\approx\n"
"\\frac{\\mathbb{I} + \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_x \\rho) \\sigma_x + \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_y \\rho) \\sigma_y + \\operatorname{Tr}(\\sigma_z \\rho) \\sigma_z}{2}\n"
"= \\rho.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the limit as $N$ approaches infinity, this approximation converges in probability to the true density matrix $\\rho$ by the *law of large numbers,* and well-known statistical bounds (such as *Hoeffding's inequality*) can be used to bound the probability that the approximation $\\tilde{\\rho}$ deviates from $\\rho$ by varying amounts.\n"
msgstr "$N$이 무한대로 접근함에 따라, 이 근사는 *큰 수의 법칙*에 의해 확률적으로 참 밀도 행렬 $\\rho$로 수렴하며, 잘 알려진 통계적 한계 (예: *Hoeffding 부등식*)를 사용하여 근사 $\\tilde{\\rho}$가 다양한 양만큼 $\\rho$에서 벗어날 확률을 제한할 수 있습니다.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An important thing to recognize, however, is that the matrix $\\tilde{\\rho}$ obtained in this way may fail to be a density matrix.\n"
"In particular, although it will always have trace equal to $1$, it may fail to be positive semidefinite.\n"
"There are different known strategies for \"rounding\" such an approximation $\\tilde{\\rho}$ to a density matrix,\n"
"one of them being to compute a spectral decomposition, replace any negative eigenvalues with $0$, and then renormalize (by dividing the matrix we obtain by its trace).\n"
msgstr ""
"그러나 인식해야 할 중요한 점은 이러한 방식으로 얻은 행렬 $\\tilde{\\rho}$이 밀도 행렬이 아닐 수 있다는 것입니다.\n"
"특히, 추적이 항상 $1$과 같을 수 있지만, 양의 반정부호이지 않을 수 있습니다.\n"
"그러한 근사 $\\tilde{\\rho}$를 밀도 행렬로 \"반올림\"하기 위한 다양한 알려진 전략이 있으며, 그 중 하나는 스펙트럼 분해를 계산하고, 음수 고유값을 $0$으로 바꾸고, 그 다음 (얻은 행렬을 그 추적으로 나누어) 정규화하는 것입니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qubit tomography using the tetrahedral measurement {#qubit-tomography-using-the-tetrahedral-measurement}"
msgstr "사면체 측정을 사용한 qubit 톰그래피 {#qubit-tomography-using-the-tetrahedral-measurement}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Another option for performing qubit tomography is to measure every qubit $\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N$ using the tetrahedral measurement\n"
"$\\{P_0,P_1,P_2,P_3\\}$ described earlier.\n"
"That is,\n"
msgstr ""
"Qubit 톰그래피를 수행하기 위한 또 다른 옵션은 모든 qubit $\\mathsf{X}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{X}_N$을 앞에서 설명한 사면체 측정 $\\{P_0,P_1,P_2,P_3\\}$를 사용하여 측정하는 것입니다.\n"
"즉,\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"P_0 = \\frac{\\vert \\phi_0 \\rangle \\langle \\phi_0 \\vert}{2}, \\quad\n"
"P_1 = \\frac{\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle \\langle \\phi_1 \\vert}{2}, \\quad\n"
"P_2 = \\frac{\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle \\langle \\phi_2 \\vert}{2}, \\quad\n"
"P_3 = \\frac{\\vert \\phi_3 \\rangle \\langle \\phi_3 \\vert}{2}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"P_0 = \\frac{\\vert \\phi_0 \\rangle \\langle \\phi_0 \\vert}{2}, \\quad\n"
"P_1 = \\frac{\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle \\langle \\phi_1 \\vert}{2}, \\quad\n"
"P_2 = \\frac{\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle \\langle \\phi_2 \\vert}{2}, \\quad\n"
"P_3 = \\frac{\\vert \\phi_3 \\rangle \\langle \\phi_3 \\vert}{2}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "for\n"
msgstr "여기서\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert \\phi_0 \\rangle & = \\vert 0 \\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle & = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} \\vert 0 \\rangle + \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}} \\vert 1 \\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle & = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} \\vert 0 \\rangle + \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}} e^{2\\pi i/3} \\vert 1 \\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\vert \\phi_3 \\rangle & = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} \\vert 0 \\rangle + \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}} e^{-2\\pi i/3} \\vert 1 \\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert \\phi_0 \\rangle & = \\vert 0 \\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle & = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} \\vert 0 \\rangle + \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}} \\vert 1 \\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle & = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} \\vert 0 \\rangle + \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}} e^{2\\pi i/3} \\vert 1 \\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\vert \\phi_3 \\rangle & = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} \\vert 0 \\rangle + \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}} e^{-2\\pi i/3} \\vert 1 \\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each outcome is obtained some number of times, which we will denote as $n_a$ for each $a\\in\\{0,1,2,3\\}$, so that $n_0 + n_1 + n_2 + n_3 = N$.\n"
"The ratio of these numbers with $N$ provides an estimate of the probability associated with each possible outcome:\n"
msgstr ""
"각 결과는 특정 횟수로 얻어지는데, 각 $a\\in\\{0,1,2,3\\}$에 대해 이를 $n_a$로 표시하겠습니다. 따라서 $n_0 + n_1 + n_2 + n_3 = N$입니다.\n"
"이러한 숫자와 $N$의 비율은 각 가능한 결과와 관련된 확률의 추정을 제공합니다:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{n_a}{N} \\approx \\operatorname{Tr}(P_a \\rho).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{n_a}{N} \\approx \\operatorname{Tr}(P_a \\rho).\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, we shall make use of the following remarkable formula:\n"
msgstr "마지막으로, 우리는 다음의 놀라운 공식을 사용할 것입니다:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\rho = \\sum_{a=0}^3 \\Bigl( 3 \\operatorname{Tr}(P_a \\rho) - \\frac{1}{2}\\Bigr) \\vert \\phi_a \\rangle \\langle \\phi_a \\vert.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\rho = \\sum_{a=0}^3 \\Bigl( 3 \\operatorname{Tr}(P_a \\rho) - \\frac{1}{2}\\Bigr) \\vert \\phi_a \\rangle \\langle \\phi_a \\vert.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To establish this formula, we can use the following equation for the absolute values squared of inner products of tetrahedral states, which can be checked through direct calculations.\n"
msgstr "이 공식을 확립하기 위해, 우리는 사면체 상태의 내적의 절대값 제곱에 대한 다음 방정식을 사용할 수 있습니다. 이는 직접 계산을 통해 확인할 수 있습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\vert \\langle \\phi_a \\vert \\phi_b \\rangle \\bigr\\vert^2 =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & a=b\\\\\n"
"\\frac{1}{3} & a\\neq b.\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\vert \\langle \\phi_a \\vert \\phi_b \\rangle \\bigr\\vert^2 =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & a=b\\\\\n"
"\\frac{1}{3} & a\\neq b.\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The four matrices\n"
msgstr "네 개의 행렬\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert\\phi_0\\rangle \\langle \\phi_0 \\vert & = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0\\\\[2mm] 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\[3mm]\n"
"\\vert\\phi_1\\rangle \\langle \\phi_1 \\vert & = \\begin{pmatrix} \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3} & \\frac{2}{3}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\[3mm]\n"
"\\vert\\phi_2\\rangle \\langle \\phi_2 \\vert & = \\begin{pmatrix} \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}e^{-2\\pi i/3}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}e^{2\\pi i/3} & \\frac{2}{3}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\[3mm]\n"
"\\vert\\phi_3\\rangle \\langle \\phi_3 \\vert & = \\begin{pmatrix} \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}e^{2\\pi i/3}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}e^{-2\\pi i/3} & \\frac{2}{3}\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert\\phi_0\\rangle \\langle \\phi_0 \\vert & = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0\\\\[2mm] 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\[3mm]\n"
"\\vert\\phi_1\\rangle \\langle \\phi_1 \\vert & = \\begin{pmatrix} \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3} & \\frac{2}{3}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\[3mm]\n"
"\\vert\\phi_2\\rangle \\langle \\phi_2 \\vert & = \\begin{pmatrix} \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}e^{-2\\pi i/3}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}e^{2\\pi i/3} & \\frac{2}{3}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\[3mm]\n"
"\\vert\\phi_3\\rangle \\langle \\phi_3 \\vert & = \\begin{pmatrix} \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}e^{2\\pi i/3}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}e^{-2\\pi i/3} & \\frac{2}{3}\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"are linearly independent, so it suffices to prove that the formula is true when $\\rho = \\vert\\phi_b\\rangle\\langle\\phi_b\\vert$\n"
"for $b = 0,1,2,3$.\n"
"In particular,\n"
msgstr ""
"은 선형 독립이므로$,\\rho = \\vert\\phi_b\\rangle\\langle\\phi_b\\vert$ (여기서 $b = 0,1,2,3$)일 때 공식이 참임을 증명하는 것으로 충분합니다.\n"
"특히,\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"3 \\operatorname{Tr}(P_a \\vert\\phi_b\\rangle\\langle\\phi_b\\vert) - \\frac{1}{2}\n"
"= \\frac{3}{2} \\vert \\langle \\phi_a \\vert \\phi_b \\rangle \\vert^2 - \\frac{1}{2}\n"
"= \\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & a=b\\\\\n"
"0 & a\\neq b\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"3 \\operatorname{Tr}(P_a \\vert\\phi_b\\rangle\\langle\\phi_b\\vert) - \\frac{1}{2}\n"
"= \\frac{3}{2} \\vert \\langle \\phi_a \\vert \\phi_b \\rangle \\vert^2 - \\frac{1}{2}\n"
"= \\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & a=b\\\\\n"
"0 & a\\neq b\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "and therefore\n"
msgstr "따라서\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{a=0}^3 \\biggl( 3 \\operatorname{Tr}(P_a \\vert\\phi_b\\rangle\\langle\\phi_b\\vert) - \\frac{\\operatorname{Tr}(\\vert\\phi_b\\rangle\\langle\\phi_b\\vert)}{2}\\biggr) \\vert \\phi_a \\rangle \\langle \\phi_a \\vert = \\vert \\phi_b\\rangle\\langle \\phi_b \\vert.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{a=0}^3 \\biggl( 3 \\operatorname{Tr}(P_a \\vert\\phi_b\\rangle\\langle\\phi_b\\vert) - \\frac{\\operatorname{Tr}(\\vert\\phi_b\\rangle\\langle\\phi_b\\vert)}{2}\\biggr) \\vert \\phi_a \\rangle \\langle \\phi_a \\vert = \\vert \\phi_b\\rangle\\langle \\phi_b \\vert.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We arrive at an approximation of $\\rho:$\n"
msgstr "우리는 $\\rho$의 근사에 도달합니다:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\tilde{\\rho} = \\sum_{a=0}^3 \\Bigl( \\frac{3 n_a}{N} - \\frac{1}{2}\\Bigr) \\vert \\phi_a \\rangle \\langle \\phi_a \\vert.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\tilde{\\rho} = \\sum_{a=0}^3 \\Bigl( \\frac{3 n_a}{N} - \\frac{1}{2}\\Bigr) \\vert \\phi_a \\rangle \\langle \\phi_a \\vert.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This approximation will always be a Hermitian matrix having trace equal to one, but it may fail to be positive semidefinite.\n"
"In this case, the approximation must be \"rounded\" to a density matrix, similar to the strategy involving Pauli measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"이 근사는 항상 추적이 1과 같은 Hermitian 행렬일 것입니다. 그러나 양의 반정부호이지 않을 수 있습니다.\n"
"이 경우, 근사는 Pauli 측정을 포함하는 전략과 유사하게 밀도 행렬로 \"반올림\"되어야 합니다.\n"
